C.  Statement: <m>???</m>
    Feedback:  Close, but the product rule adds the two terms, not subtracts them.

D.  Statement: <m>???</m>
    Feedback:  This differentiates only the <m>\sin(x)</m> factor and leaves
               <m>x^2</m> alone. The product rule requires differentiating
               each factor in turn: <m>f'g + fg'</m>.
